<title>UK: CYCLING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
